<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header class="top">
  <a class="brand" href="/"><div class="brandmark">HX</div><span>HEX CHEATS SHOP<small>ACCESS / BUILT FOR SPEED</small></span></a>
  <nav class="nav"><a class="navlink" href="#catalog">Catalog</a><a class="navlink" href="#orders">Orders</a><label class="currency-control" for="currencySelect">Currency<select id="currencySelect" aria-label="Display currency"><option value="INR">INR ₹</option><option value="USD">USD $</option></select></label><span class="balance-chip hidden" id="navBalance">₹0.00</span><button class="navbtn" id="authOpen">Sign in</button><a class="button secondary" href="/admin">Admin</a></nav>
</header>
<main>
<section class="hero">
  <div><div class="eyebrow">Digital access, ready when you are</div><h1>Make your next<br><em>move count.</em></h1><p>Browse the HEX catalog, choose the access period that fits, and complete checkout securely. Your order key stays available in your account history.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#catalog">Explore products</a><button class="button secondary" id="heroAccount">My account</button></div></div>
  <aside class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-top"><span>HEX DIGITAL STORE</span><span class="live">ONLINE</span></div><div class="stat-number" id="productCount">—</div><div class="stat-caption">products currently available</div><div class="stat-lines"><div><span>Payment</span><b>FamGateway</b></div><div><span>Delivery</span><b>Digital key</b></div><div><span>Support</span><b>Order history</b></div></div></aside>
</section>
<section class="account-panel" id="accountPanel"><div class="account-card"><div><div class="account-name" id="accountName">Signed in</div><div class="account-sub" id="accountMeta"></div></div><button class="button ghost" id="logoutButton">Sign out</button></div><div class="profile-grid"><div class="profile-box"><h3>User profile</h3><form id="profileForm"><label for="profileDisplayName">Display name</label><input id="profileDisplayName" maxlength="100" required><div class="error" id="profileError"></div><button class="button secondary" type="submit">Save profile</button></form></div><div class="wallet-box"><h3>Wallet balance · INR</h3><div class="wallet-balance" id="walletBalance">₹0.00</div><form id="topupForm" class="wallet-form"><div class="field"><label for="topupAmount">Add funds (₹50–₹50,000)</label><input id="topupAmount" type="number" min="50" max="50000" step="1" value="500" required></div><button class="button" id="topupButton" type="submit">Top up</button></form><div class="hint">Top-ups and purchases are charged and settled in INR.</div><div class="error" id="topupError"></div><div class="wallet-txn-list" id="walletTransactions"><div class="hint">Loading wallet activity…</div></div></div></div><h3 class="orders-heading">Orders</h3><div class="orders" id="orders"></div></section>
<section class="section" id="catalog"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Current line-up</div><h2>Choose your access.</h2><p>Prices and available durations are managed by the shop administrator.</p><p class="hint" id="currencyNote">Wallet balances and all payments settle in INR.</p></div><div class="filters"><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search products…" aria-label="Search products"></div></div><div class="catalog" id="catalogGrid"><div class="empty">Loading catalog…</div></div></section>
</main>
<footer class="footer"><span>© <span id="year"><?= date('Y') ?></span> HEX CHEATS SHOP</span><span>Track payment and delivery from your shop account.</span></footer>
</div>
<div class="modal hidden" id="purchaseChoiceModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="purchaseChoiceTitle"><div class="dialog"><div class="dialog-head"><div><h2 id="purchaseChoiceTitle">Choose payment method</h2><p id="purchaseProduct"></p></div><button class="close" data-close="purchaseChoiceModal" aria-label="Close">×</button></div><div class="dialog-body"><div class="choice-detail"><div id="purchaseDisplayPrice"></div><div id="purchaseInrPrice"></div><div id="walletChoiceBalance" class="muted"></div></div><div class="choice-note">USD is a display option only when a USD price is configured. Wallet balance and payment gateway settlement remain in INR.</div><div class="choice-actions"><button class="button secondary" id="payWalletButton">Pay from wallet</button><button class="button" id="payOnlineButton">Pay online</button></div><div class="error" id="purchaseChoiceError"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="modal hidden" id="authModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="authTitle"><div class="dialog"><div class="dialog-head"><div><h2 id="authTitle">Your shop account</h2><p>Sign in to checkout and keep your order keys together.</p></div><button class="close" data-close="authModal" aria-label="Close">×</button></div><div class="dialog-body"><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" id="loginTab">Sign in</button><button class="tab" id="registerTab">Create account</button></div><form id="authForm"><div class="field hidden" id="nameField"><label for="displayName">Display name</label><input id="displayName" maxlength="100" autocomplete="name"></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" type="email" maxlength="254" required autocomplete="email"></div><div class="field"><label for="password">Password</label><input id="password" type="password" minlength="10" maxlength="256" required autocomplete="current-password"></div><button class="button wide" id="authSubmit" type="submit">Sign in</button><div class="error" id="authError"></div></form><p class="hint">Email accounts require a password of at least 10 characters. Your account keeps your order history and delivery keys together.</p></div></div></div>
<div class="modal payment-modal hidden" id="paymentModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="paymentTitle"><div class="dialog"><div class="dialog-head"><div><h2 id="paymentTitle">Complete payment</h2><p>After paying, leave this window open while we verify your order.</p></div><button class="close" data-close="paymentModal" aria-label="Close">×</button></div><div class="dialog-body"><div class="payment-details" id="paymentDetails"></div><img class="payment-qr" id="paymentQr" alt="Payment QR code"><a class="button wide" id="paymentLink" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open secure payment page</a><div class="hint" id="paymentStatus">Waiting for payment…</div><div class="payment-actions"><button class="button secondary" id="checkPayment">Check payment</button><button class="button ghost" data-close="paymentModal">Close</button></div></div></div></div>
<div class="toast hidden" id="toast" role="status"></div>
<script src="/storefront.js" defer></script>
